# API Service Patterns and Networking

## API Architecture Overview

The Mobile app uses a layered API architecture with consistent request/response patterns and comprehensive error handling.

### API Service Structure

```
src/services/
├── api/
│   ├── api.ts              # API endpoint constants
│   ├── index.ts            # Export definitions and types
│   ├── user.ts             # User authentication and profile
│   ├── premia.ts           # Premia store services
│   ├── retailers.ts        # Retailer location services
│   ├── vouchers.ts         # Voucher management
│   ├── pets.ts             # Pet management
│   ├── points.ts           # Points and transactions
│   ├── scanning.ts         # QR code and product scanning
│   └── notifications.ts    # Push notifications
└── networking/
    ├── axios.ts            # Axios instance configuration
    └── index.ts            # HTTP method wrappers
```

